                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center dark:text-gray-300"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mr-2">✓</span> Détection automatique des scènes</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center dark:text-gray-300"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mr-2">✓</span> Sous-titrage automatique en 50 langues</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center dark:text-gray-300"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mr-2">✓</span> Suppression du bruit de fond intelligente</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 h-80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-inner relative flex items-center justify-center p-4">
