                    <li class="flex items-center dark:text-gray-300"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mr-2">✓</span> Identification des sources et auteurs</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center dark:text-gray-300"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mr-2">✓</span> Installation en un clic</li>
