            <a href="/connexion" class="inline-block bg-white text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition border-2 border-transparent hover:border-blue-400 shadow-lg">Commencer l'essai gratuit</a>
